  "description": "Unmapped DEN.C7 local concepts for ICD-11 MMS; the source marks the recorded concepts not classifiable and leaves the DEN.C7.2.DE1 question code blank.",
  "text": {
    "status": "additional",
    "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>The source marks DEN.C7.1.DE1 and its three answer options, plus DEN.C7.2.DE2–DE5, “Not classifiable in ICD-11”. The DEN.C7.2.DE1 question row has a blank ICD-11 cell. No target is asserted for either case.</p><p>Blank and not-classifiable cells are retained as unmapped entries, not treated as terminology concepts.</p></div>"
  },
